      "content": "i know i'm not \"defined\" by it but it's still what my life is. it feels like some kind of error in the system, like i just wasn't built for this world. it's not even that i want to \"do\" anything, i just want the option to not have to exist in this constant struggle. wouldn't it be easier if the struggle just... ended?",
